       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GEMCBLPGM.
      *======================================================================
      * Program: GEMCBLPGM (COBOL Version)
      * Description: SQLCBLLE wrapper for GEMINI_QUERY using SQL to read
      *              the data area for the API key.
      *
      * Compilation:
      *   CRTSQLCBLI OBJ(YOURLIB/GEMCBLPGM) 
      *              SRCSTMF('/path/to/GEMCBLPGM.sqlcblle')
      *              COMMIT(*NONE) OBJTYPE(*PGM) CVTCCSID(*JOB)
      *======================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-I.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-I.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.

      * H-CONTENT holds the JSON request body. The JSON wrapper overhead is
      * ~38 chars, leaving ~4962 chars for the (already sanitised) query text.
       01  WS-SQL-VARS.
            05  H-MODEL         PIC X(100).
            05  H-KEY           PIC X(100).
            05  H-CONTENT       PIC X(5000).
            05  H-RESULT        PIC X(5000).

       01  WS-VARIABLES.
             05  WS-DTAARA-NAME  PIC X(10) VALUE "GEMINIKEY".
             05  WS-LIBL         PIC X(10) VALUE "*LIBL".
             05  WS-IDX          PIC S9(4) COMP.
             05  WS-ESCAPED-QUERY PIC X(5000).
             05  WS-ESC-IDX      PIC S9(4) COMP.
             05  WS-CHAR         PIC X(1).
             05  WS-BACKSLASH    PIC X(1).

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  P-MODEL             PIC X(100).
       01  P-CONTENT           PIC X(5000).
       01  P-RESULT            PIC X(5000).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING P-MODEL P-CONTENT P-RESULT.
      * Initialize result
           MOVE SPACES TO P-RESULT.

      * Override with parameters if provided
           IF P-MODEL = SPACES
               MOVE "gemini-2.5-flash" TO H-MODEL
           ELSE
               MOVE P-MODEL TO H-MODEL
           END-IF.

           IF P-CONTENT = SPACES
               MOVE "What is IBM i?" TO P-CONTENT
           ELSE
      * Sanitize command-line garbage by replacing control chars with spaces
               PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 5000
                   IF P-CONTENT(WS-IDX:1) < SPACE
                       MOVE SPACE TO P-CONTENT(WS-IDX:1)
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
           END-IF.
           
      * Escape JSON special characters in the query before embedding
           PERFORM ESCAPE-JSON-CONTENT.

      * Build JSON content
           MOVE SPACES TO H-CONTENT
           STRING '{"contents":[{"parts":[{"text":"' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ESCAPED-QUERY) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  '"}]}]}' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO H-CONTENT
           END-STRING.

      * Read API key from Data Area using SQL
           MOVE SPACES TO H-KEY.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT TRIM(DATA_AREA_VALUE)
               INTO :H-KEY
               FROM TABLE(QSYS2.DATA_AREA_INFO(
                   DATA_AREA_NAME    => :WS-DTAARA-NAME,
                   DATA_AREA_LIBRARY => :WS-LIBL))
           END-EXEC.

           IF SQLCODE NOT = 0 OR H-KEY = SPACES
              DISPLAY "Error: API key not found in data area GEMINIKEY"
              GOBACK
           END-IF.

      * Call the GEMINI_QUERY function
           DISPLAY "--- DEBUG INFO ---"
           DISPLAY "MODEL:   " H-MODEL(1:50)
           DISPLAY "CONTENT1:" H-CONTENT(1:100)
           DISPLAY "CONTENT2:" H-CONTENT(101:100)
           DISPLAY "CONTENT3:" H-CONTENT(201:100)
           DISPLAY "------------------"
           MOVE SPACES TO H-RESULT.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT CAST(GEMINI_QUERY(
                   TRIM(:H-MODEL),
                   TRIM(:H-KEY),
                   TRIM(:H-CONTENT)
               ) AS VARCHAR(5000))
               INTO :H-RESULT
               FROM SYSIBM.SYSDUMMY1
           END-EXEC.

           IF SQLCODE = 0
              DISPLAY "Success"
              MOVE H-RESULT TO P-RESULT
           ELSE
              DISPLAY "Error calling GEMINI_QUERY. SQLSTATE: " SQLSTATE
              MOVE "ERROR" TO P-RESULT
           END-IF.

           GOBACK.

       ESCAPE-JSON-CONTENT.
      * Escape backslash (X'E0') and double-quote in P-CONTENT for JSON.
      * Backslash must be processed before double-quote to avoid double-escaping.
           MOVE X'E0' TO WS-BACKSLASH.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-ESCAPED-QUERY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ESC-IDX.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 5000
               MOVE P-CONTENT(WS-IDX:1) TO WS-CHAR
               EVALUATE TRUE
                   WHEN WS-CHAR = WS-BACKSLASH
                       IF WS-ESC-IDX <= 4999
                           MOVE WS-BACKSLASH TO
                               WS-ESCAPED-QUERY(WS-ESC-IDX:1)
                           ADD 1 TO WS-ESC-IDX
                           MOVE WS-BACKSLASH TO
                               WS-ESCAPED-QUERY(WS-ESC-IDX:1)
                           ADD 1 TO WS-ESC-IDX
                       END-IF
                   WHEN WS-CHAR = '"'
                       IF WS-ESC-IDX <= 4999
                           MOVE WS-BACKSLASH TO
                               WS-ESCAPED-QUERY(WS-ESC-IDX:1)
                           ADD 1 TO WS-ESC-IDX
                           MOVE '"' TO WS-ESCAPED-QUERY(WS-ESC-IDX:1)
                           ADD 1 TO WS-ESC-IDX
                       END-IF
                   WHEN OTHER
                       IF WS-ESC-IDX <= 5000
                          MOVE WS-CHAR TO WS-ESCAPED-QUERY(WS-ESC-IDX:1)
                           ADD 1 TO WS-ESC-IDX
                       END-IF
               END-EVALUATE
           END-PERFORM.
